<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ortel cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ortel cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said on Wednesday it had cut its rating for Ortel Corp to neutral from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Alhambra, Calif., fiber optics products company closed at 20-5/8 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
